    "title": "SEO Audits That Miss the Point",
    "metaTitle": "SEO Audits That Miss the Point | Shinobi",
    "metaDescription": "Learn how to turn SEO audit warnings into prioritised tasks with evidence, clear owners, acceptance checks and live retests for creative websites.",
    "readingTime": "9 min read",
